From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: aiueo52 <aiueo52@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 22:14:04 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 119/121] RS3: block verification in the sparse chain RS verify
 (SGLANG_RS_BLOCK_VERIFY)

Sun et al. block verification for RS2's draft chain: pi/h per position,
tau = last position whose coin passes, final draw from max(pi_tau p - q, 0)
or p at tau = G. Constexpr-gated; with the flag unset the kernel and call
kwargs are the G1 commit's. Requires SGLANG_OPT_SPEC_SPARSE_RS.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
